{"amount_text": "解体費用の5分の4の額(1,000円未満切り捨て)で、上限は50万円", "checked_on": "2026-09-15", "first_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "history": [{"at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "event": "created"}], "kind": "解体", "kind_quote": null, "last_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "name": "危険な空き家の解体費を助成します", "period_end": null, "period_text": null, "provenance": {"content_hash": "sha256:6a5500499e8f5eecccadae2389a4b64a970196a6fe4054cb2087af30240810c3", "extractor": {"cached": false, "extracted_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08Z", "input_tokens": 3475, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "output_tokens": 177, "prompt_version": "subsidy_v1", "provider": "anthropic"}, "fetched_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:05Z", "license": null, "page_kind": "subsidy", "source_url": "https://www.town.hirono.iwate.jp/doc/2020060100050/"}, "record_id": "6940b3a0f2b3246f", "scope": "空き家", "source_id": "iwate-035076", "status": "active", "summary": "町内の危険な空き家の解体工事に対し、解体費用の5分の4（上限50万円）を補助。対象は町民で、町税滞納がなく、空き家の所有者または相続人であること。", "url": "https://www.town.hirono.iwate.jp/doc/2020060100050/", "year_text": null}
{"amount_text": "環境整備に要する経費の10分の10の額で10万円が限度、リフォーム工事に要する経費の2分の1以内の額で30万円が限度", "checked_on": "2026-09-15", "first_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "history": [{"at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "event": "created"}], "kind": "改修", "kind_quote": null, "last_seen_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08+00:00", "name": "洋野町空き家等活用促進助成金", "period_end": null, "period_text": "空き家等の売買又は賃貸借契約を締結する前、又は、空き家等の売買又は賃貸借契約を締結した日から2年以内", "provenance": {"content_hash": "sha256:701e259cc7c2d35b5bbad5b92809a4ace463da232fb37f92bb8d277d70d9a2e2", "extractor": {"cached": false, "extracted_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:08Z", "input_tokens": 3266, "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "output_tokens": 243, "prompt_version": "subsidy_v1", "provider": "anthropic"}, "fetched_at": "2026-09-14T23:06:01Z", "license": null, "page_kind": "subsidy", "source_url": "https://www.town.hirono.iwate.jp/doc/2019060600035/"}, "record_id": "a8638c1fca3cd7e2", "scope": "空き家", "source_id": "iwate-035076", "status": "active", "summary": "空き家等バンク登録物件の環境整備（家財処分など）とリフォーム工事に要する経費を助成。環境整備は10万円限度、リフォームは30万円限度。", "url": "https://www.town.hirono.iwate.jp/doc/2019060600035/", "year_text": null}
